...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 (브라우저) { class: person }
adk_web: adk web 서버 { class: ext }
agent: 컨설턴트 에이전트 (root_agent) { class: ours }
local_tools: 로컬 분석 도구 { class: ours }
search_tool: Perplexity 검색 도구 { class: ours }
runner: Runner + 세션 서비스 { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-2.5-flash) { class: ext }
perplexity: Perplexity API (sonar) { class: ext }

user -> adk_web: 질문 텍스트
adk_web -> agent: root_agent 조회
agent -> local_tools
agent -> search_tool
agent -> runner
agent -> gemini
search_tool -> perplexity
